(7306242, 1140029, 136989, '<td valign="top">Very visually appealing!  I love the depth the background texture adds and those eyes definitely convey "mine". My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Very visually appealing!  I love the depth the background texture adds and those eyes definitely convey "mine". My favorite in this challenge.', '2015-01-23 22:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
