(7306330, 1140015, 177553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Good focus on the texture of the shoe.  The laces and soles seem a bit blown out though.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Good focus on the texture of the shoe.  The laces and soles seem a bit blown out though.', '2015-01-24 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306332, 1140036, 177553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the idea, well, sort of.  Its sad.  I would have preferred the sticks ( weeds? ) on the top of the stump be cleared and maybe a slightly wider view so the headstone isn''t chopped at the edge..  Curious what this looked like in color.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the idea, well, sort of.  Its sad.  I would have preferred the sticks ( weeds? ) on the top of the stump be cleared and maybe a slightly wider view so the headstone isn''t chopped at the edge..  Curious what this looked like in color.', '2015-01-24 11:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306333, 1139990, 177553, '<td valign="top">Good job, although the lack of shadows kind of flattens the shot for me. I would be curious to see it with more depth in the shadows.  I like the background, it fits well here.</td>', 'Good job, although the lack of shadows kind of flattens the shot for me. I would be curious to see it with more depth in the shadows.  I like the background, it fits well here.', '2015-01-24 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306334, 1140040, 177553, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but maybe the floor should have been vacuumed first?  A slightly different angle focusing on the shoes could have helped here as well.</td>', 'Good idea, but maybe the floor should have been vacuumed first?  A slightly different angle focusing on the shoes could have helped here as well.', '2015-01-24 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306336, 1140019, 177553, '<td valign="top">Too cute!  I like this a lot.  Well done.</td>', 'Too cute!  I like this a lot.  Well done.', '2015-01-24 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306337, 1140021, 177553, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  I like the idea.  Two distractions that take away from the shot for me are the polish tin being out of focus and the background making the water almost invisible.  Good job.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  I like the idea.  Two distractions that take away from the shot for me are the polish tin being out of focus and the background making the water almost invisible.  Good job.', '2015-01-24 11:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306338, 1140003, 177553, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  The DOF here is a little distracting for me.  The laces are out of focus and possibly the toes of the shoes.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  The DOF here is a little distracting for me.  The laces are out of focus and possibly the toes of the shoes.', '2015-01-24 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306339, 1139976, 177553, '<td valign="top">Good job.  I like the lighting here.  Well done.</td>', 'Good job.  I like the lighting here.  Well done.', '2015-01-24 11:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306340, 1139781, 177553, '<td valign="top">Ok, have a little heart for those of us OCD folks that cant help but count, and then to hide a pair off the side of the frame, and the mismatched sets in the middle of the frame are just cruel. :)<br/> <br/>But actually, I like this shot.  Good job.</td>', 'Ok, have a little heart for those of us OCD folks that cant help but count, and then to hide a pair off the side of the frame, and the mismatched sets in the middle of the frame are just cruel. :) But actually, I like this shot.  Good job.', '2015-01-24 11:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7306363, 1139807, 83149, '<td valign="top">I like the nice clean look and bright colours, but it looks like too much light on the background causing some minor blow outs on the shoes.</td>', 'I like the nice clean look and bright colours, but it looks like too much light on the background causing some minor blow outs on the shoes.', '2015-01-24 13:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
