(7306371, 1139787, 177553, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  I like the worn used look here. Focus is a bit soft in my opinion, or is it these old eyes failing me again. Either way, good job.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  I like the worn used look here. Focus is a bit soft in my opinion, or is it these old eyes failing me again. Either way, good job.', '2015-01-24 13:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
