(7306373, 1139763, 177553, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here. Seems like a soft focus on the top shoe, maybe DOF was a little shallow for my liking.  Lighting doesn''t really appeal to the shot in my opinion.  Maybe from a side would have been more interesting?</td>', 'I like the idea here. Seems like a soft focus on the top shoe, maybe DOF was a little shallow for my liking.  Lighting doesn''t really appeal to the shot in my opinion.  Maybe from a side would have been more interesting?', '2015-01-24 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
