(7308336, 1139976, 128323, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by damjanev:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by damjanev:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shoes and nicely shot photo.<br/>I would have faced the shoes the other way, though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The Louboutin signature are the red soles :)<br/> <br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The other, other way :-) Facing right. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s how I read it :)  Thanks for the comment, wish I would have tried a shot like that...</td>', 'Originally posted by damjanev: Originally posted by tanguera: Originally posted by damjanev: Nice shoes and nicely shot photo.I would have faced the shoes the other way, though.   The Louboutin signature are the red soles :)   The other, other way :-) Facing right.   That''s how I read it :)  Thanks for the comment, wish I would have tried a shot like that...', '2015-01-30 15:32:19.000000', NULL, 0),
